# Extension host

- Register all disposables on `context.subscriptions`.
- Status bar: `StatusBarAlignment.Right`, priority ~100. Current and Today command = `cursorCost.showHistory`. Refresh = `cursorCost.refresh` (spins while fetching). Do not give the Refresh status bar item an `id` (a named id matching the command stays hidden after overflow). Keep Refresh's priority above the 1–10 recent query chips so it sits after Current/Today, not on the window edge. Export CSV stays on the Last N toolbar (`cursorCost.exportCsv`), not the status bar. Budget hover is trusted MarkdownString with `supportHtml` + theme icons; user-provided email/plan/model names are escaped.
- Theme colors: `charts.green` / yellow / `charts.red`. Loading: `$(loading~spin)`.
- `onStartupFinished` — status bar visible after startup.
- Reuse one `WebviewPanel` (`cursorCost.history`). `retainContextWhenHidden: true`.
- Configuration only via `cursorCost.*` keys from PRD. Watch `onDidChangeConfiguration`.
- `extensionKind`: `ui`. Document Remote SSH: no local `state.vscdb` on remote host.
- No `enabledApiProposals`.
